  "title": "Deviled Pickled Eggs",
  "description": "Deviled eggs made from eggs pickled in a beet juice brine are a colorful addition to the appetizer table and perfect when watching the big game or Easter.",
  "authors": [
    "Kathy Van Pelt"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:58:04-04:00",
